  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Feasibility Study - Mexico Micro-Scale Liquefied Natural Gas Plants, through The Lisbon Group</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Jalisco Small-Scale Liquefied Natural Gas (LNG) Plant Feasibility Study is to complete the frontend engineering design for a 100,000 gallons per day liquified natural gas facility in west-central Mexico. The Mexico Micro-Scale LNG Plants Feasibility Study will assess site selection and complete the engineering design for four natural gas facilities throughout Mexico.</narrative>
  </description>
